<header><p class="st-kicker">protectorate · Mainland Southeast Asia</p><h1 class="st-title">Protectorate General to Pacify the South</h1><p class="st-meta">679 CE – 866 CE · capital Songping</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The Tang dynasty's southern frontier command in northern Vietnam, whose name Annan, 'the pacified south', long remained a Chinese name for the country.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>In 679 the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tang-dynasty">Tang dynasty</a> reorganised its territories in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/red-river-asia">Red River</a> delta, earlier <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jiao-province">Jiaozhou</a>, into the Annan duhufu, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protectorate">Protectorate</a> General to Pacify the South, one of several frontier protectorates. Its seat lay at Songping, later fortified as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dai-la">Dai La</a> on the site of present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanoi">Hanoi</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p><a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/later-tang">Tang</a> governors ruled through prefectures and counties, collecting tax in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rice">rice</a>, salt and tribute goods and keeping garrisons against hill peoples and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/champa">Champa</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/buddhism">Buddhism</a> flourished, and local elites learned Chinese letters. Heavy taxation provoked revolts, notably that of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mai-thuc-loan">Mai Thuc Loan</a> in 722 and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phung-hung">Phung Hung</a> in the 790s. Governor Zhang Boyi built the walls of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dai-la">Dai La</a> in 767.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>In the 850s and 860s <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/nanzhao">Nanzhao</a> invaded and briefly occupied the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protectorate">protectorate</a>. The <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/later-tang">Tang</a> general <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gao-pian">Gao Pian</a> drove them out in 866 and the region was reorganised as the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/tinh-hai-circuit">Tinh Hai Circuit</a>. The Annan name endured and was used by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> and later by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> for central <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/socialist-republic-of-vietnam">Vietnam</a>.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/protectorate-general-to-pacify-the-south.jpg" alt="Protectorate General to Pacify the South" width="320" height="228"><figcaption>Image: Lệ Xuân · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tang_China_under_Emperor_Gaozong.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>679 CE – 866 CE</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a> – <a href="/centuries/9th-century">9th century</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>protectorate</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>bureaucratic</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Songping</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Zhang Boyi, Gao Pian</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Buddhism, Chinese folk religion</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Middle Chinese, Old Vietnamese</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/vietnam">Vietnam</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Annan Protectorate, Annam, Annan</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=772&amp;focus=protectorate-general-to-pacify-the-south" aria-label="Protectorate General to Pacify the South on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="7504 1388 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Protectorate General to Pacify the South lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M7771 1192h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7824 1644h0"/><path class="map-dot-ap" d="M7824 1644h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>Location approximate: shown in present-day Vietnam. <a href="/atlas?year=772&amp;focus=protectorate-general-to-pacify-the-south">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>
